{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2026-01", "window": 1, "start_date": 1767225600, "end_date": 1767830399, "month_true_total": 114, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 22:02:38 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "215435512", "author": {"steamid": "76561198369163776", "personaname": "Fru1tez", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198369163776/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 39, "playtime_forever": 1286, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 956, "last_played": 1767897967, "avatar": "5381a96ab34eafe349a21211a0f13a7384fdf52e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Is it a good ME game? No.\r\nIs it fun to play? Hell yeah.\r\nAre the quests bloated, the characters dull, and the storytelling a mess? Yeah — but who cares?\r\n\r\nPeople hate on this game way too much. I really like the engine and what they did with the movement — they were onto something. Some of the companions aren’t that mid and actually have fun dialogue (sometimes). I don’t know, I just can’t bring myself to hate it.\r\n\r\nMy main issue with the game is that there’s too much to do. I think the original trilogy proved that less is more.\r\n\r\nPS: I recommend downloading this [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/games/masseffectandromeda/collections/rw8xvk] mods collection [/url] . It makes the game much more playable and fixes the majority of its issues.", "timestamp_created": 1767823144, "timestamp_updated": 1767823144, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "215427301", "author": {"steamid": "76561198302129826", "personaname": "Watcher0187", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url"